BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:folegandros-chora-dormition-panigiri-at-panagia-chora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri at Panagia\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Folegandros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The white church of Panagia on the hill above Chora — the island's landmark — celebrates the Dormition with vespers on the evening of 14 August\, a procession\, and a glenti with violin and laouto in the Chora squares\, followed by liturgy on the 15th. The island is at capacity that week\; the zig-zag path up to the church is unlit\, so bring a torch.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/folegandros/#chora-dormition-panigiri-at-panagia-chora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/folegandros/#chora-dormition-panigiri-at-panagia-chora
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
