LOCATION:Karavostasi\, Folegandros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:A harbour evening in Karavostasi built around kakavia\, the fishermen's soup: the local boats' catch is cooked in big pots on the quay and served free with wine\, with island music afterwards. Held on 21 August\; arrive early with a plate and a spoon of your own if you can\, and eat standing — there are few tables.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/folegandros/#karavostasi-kaikokakavia-fish-soup-festival-karavostasi
